# ── Binary hygiene (repository-optimization 2026-11-02) ─────────────────────
# Ignoring never untracks a committed file; it stops NEW binaries being swept in
# by `git add -A`. Legitimate product assets live under apps/web/public/ and are
# NOT matched below. To deliberately commit a reference image, use
# `git add -f` and keep it under the binary budget (tools/scripts/check-binary-budget.mjs).

# Design source / editing files: keep them in external storage, never in git.
*.psd
*.psb
*.ai
*.sketch
*.fig
*.xd
*.afdesign
*.heic
*.mov
*.mp4
*.zip
*.7z
*.tgz

# New raster images anywhere under docs/ (reference comps, screenshots, exports).
# The existing curated set in docs/design/reference/ui-ideas-2/ stays tracked.
docs/**/*.png
docs/**/*.jpg
docs/**/*.jpeg
docs/**/*.webp
docs/**/*.gif

# Playwright / Lighthouse output wherever it is generated
blob-report/
.lighthouseci/
lighthouse-report*.html

# Editor and OS cruft
.idea/
Thumbs.db
*.swp
